SUMMARY:ESGR — Call #3
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: ENSTAR GROUP LTD (ESGR)\nRoadshow: URL: https://dealroadshow.com |
  Password: ESGR2026 | Direct Link: https://dealroadshow.com/e/ESGR2026\n\n
 Deal context:\nEnstar Group Limited (ESGR)\, a Bermuda-domiciled global (r
 e)insurance run-off specialist with $21.0B in total assets and $5.1B in co
 mmon shareholders' equity\, is arranging investor calls on June 22nd\, 202
 6 ahead of a potential offering of 11NC10 junior subordinated notes in 144
 A/Reg S format\, with expected ratings of BBB-/BBB- (S&P/Fitch). The deal 
 is at the Mandate stage with no pricing terms disclosed\, and the offering
  is explicitly conditional on market conditions. The 11NC10 structure — ca
 llable after year 10 on an 11-year instrument — is consistent with hybrid 
 capital issuance typical of insurance holding companies seeking regulatory
  or economic capital treatment.
